<title>FRANCE: Generale says plans no Suez bid.</title>
<headline>Generale says plans no Suez bid.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A spokesman for Generale des Eaux confirmed that the company was not planning any bid for Cie de Suez in an attempt to block a possible merger between Suez and Lyonnaise des Eaux.</p>
<p>&quot;Jean-Marie Messier made it clear that the company is not planning a counter-bid for Suez to block a merger,&quot; a Generale des Eaux spokesman said.</p>
<p>He was commenting on newspapers reports, quoting Messier during a visit to Lisbon on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
